=== start ===
# checkpoint: start
The truck stops dead, and your forehead meets the dash with a sound you feel in your teeth. # place: The cab
Something warm runs into your left eye. A thin high note fills your ears, and under it the engine ticks as it cools.
Your sleeve comes away dark and wet. You blink until the cracked glass in front of you stops sliding sideways.
Out past the hood, where the dust is settling, the other truck has stopped side on. It's too far to hit with a thrown stone, not that you could lift one. # page
Its gun is still swung your way, and a thin grey thread of smoke climbs from the muzzle. A figure in goggles stands braced in the bed with both hands on the grips.
Your hands have gone heavy in your lap, and this time they won't lift. You wait for the shot.
The shot doesn't come. # page
When you look again, the barrel has swung up and away. The gunner pushes the goggles up, spits over the side and climbs down.
They walk to your truck slow, with a rifle slung across their back, and they don't even glance at the cab as they pass. The bed creaks under their weight. For a while you listen to them sort through what you carried, unhurried, like somebody doing chores.
{ intro_step == "ambush": Then the hood creaks up, and a wrench works at something in the engine bay for a long while. }
On the way back they stop by your door. A dented canteen lands on the seat beside you, half full and sloshing. Then boots on gravel, a door slamming, and an engine climbing off into the flat until the wind takes it. # page
You're alive. You keep the canteen in your lap while the dark comes up around the edges.
-> END
